{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me reconsider the clues. The \"play alongside their real-life relative even though unrelated in the series\" is the most distinctive clue. Let me think about shows where this happens. The Screen Rant article mentioned Jessica and Richard Harmon (The 100). But let me think about other possibilities - shows like \"Yellowstone,\" \"Outlander,\" \"This Is Us,\" etc.\n\nLet me reconsider the marriage/child clues. \"Married more than 2 but less than 5 times\" = 3 or 4 marriages. \"Only one of their child survives\" - this suggests multiple children but only one survives (others died). This is a very specific plot point.\n\nLet me search for shows with these specific plot elements.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"character married three times children died one survives TV series\", \"TV series character multiple children died only one surviving\", \"actor plays with real life spouse sibling unrelated characters series married three times\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_cc3d066b31b640539d2c450b","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Yellowstone cast real life relatives\", \"Outlander cast real life spouse sibling\", \"This Is Us cast real life family members play unrelated\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_5fa84da66df141799ef80ede","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789467773,"id":"chatcmpl-477c526c-d85e-9bf4-a652-a204be6257d1","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":15986,"completion_tokens":244,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":16230,"cached_tokens":7168,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":7168},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}